<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-PHILIPPOUSSIS BEATS CORRETJA IN MUNICH FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILIPPOUSSIS BEATS CORRETJA IN MUNICH FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the $425,000 Munich men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding): 8-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 7-6 (7-3) 1-6 6-4</p>
</text>
